      "defect_id": "authz-002-d1",
      "variants": [
        "vulnerable"
      ],
      "summary": "get_invoice checks that the user belongs to the tenant named in the request's X-Tenant header, then looks the invoice up by id across every tenant and never checks invoice.tenant_id, so a member of one tenant reads another tenant's invoice by sending their own tenant and a foreign invoice_id through handle_request. void_invoice and share_invoice use _in_tenant, which does check.",
